eur Mr. Bagchi observed it but he began to like Reena. After a while they got married together. Then they were blessed with a child . But Reena was not all comfortable with her child’s value system and psychology. So a complication was born between them. This is a story of different perspectives who forced to live life together bonded in a relationship.","popularity":0.5748,"poster_path":"/5iFvRCWzZvaXiKun0Hs1bFvH8t8.jpg","release_date":"1971-02-04","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[18],"id":688293,"title":"Jiban Trishna","original_language":"bn","original_title":"জীবন তৃষ্ণা","overview":"A philanderer, the only son of a wealthy doctor, is attracted to a poor orphaned artist. Her stepbrother loathes rich people, and would go to any extent to get money off them. What would happen if the roles reversed?","popularity":0.6521,"poster_path":"/wVGMIp3FbpXzKk6ND8hGekZ0inQ.jpg","release_date":"1957-12-25","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[18],"id":688445,"title":"Saheb Bibi Golam","original_language":"bn","original_title":"Saheb Bibi Golam","overview":"The film explores the tragic fall of feudalism in Bengal during the British Raj. The title of the movie and the story is a reference to the plot simultaneously exploring a platonic relationship between a beautiful, forlorn wife of an aristocrat and a career-driven clerk.","popularity":0.9608,"poster_path":"/o4nQBFgPkNfkpph9HyMPLm2U56K.jpg","release_date":"1956-03-09","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7,"vote_count":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[9648,10749,18],"id":688123,"title":"Sabar Uparey","original_language":"bn","original_title":"সবার উপরে","overview":"Shankar was a young lawyer in pursuit of making it big in the professional world. However, his world is turned upside down when he comes to know that his father, who he knew went missing, was in real life spending his lifetime in jail as he was incorrectly accused of murdering a lady named Hemangini. His mother urges him to reinvestigate the case and save his father. He goes to Krishnanagar in search of the people and the pieces of evidence that would help him to prove his father’s innocence. He meets Rita, a young and charming lady who assists him. They fall in love. Shankar faces a lot of roadblocks while trying to collect clues, most of them which were imposed by the actual murderer. However, he solves the mystery in the end and his father is thus released from prison.","popularity":0.726,"poster_path":"/fcrmxL9TgPPaS97TuB2hHU4xOMO.jpg","release_date":"1955-12-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7,"vote_count":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[18],"id":663957,"title":"Mahabiplabi Aurobindo","original_language":"bn","original_title":"Mahabiplabi Aurobindo","overview":"Inspired by the life of Rishi Aurobindo, it’s a Bengali classic portraying the life of Sri Aurobindo Ghosh beginning from his return to India in 1892 to his life in Pondicherry in 1910. This film shows a detailed narration of his early life, marriage, interaction with Sister Nivedita, contributions in India’s freedom struggle and activities in Jugantar, Alipore bomb blast case, and the subsequent trial.","popularity":0.672,"poster_path":"/jbYTqA70VQKXRIWq8LEmHiqWSau.jpg","release_date":"1971-01-27","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/ahxbtPTuVVFbkX8qSVqjZVCSuRd.jpg","genre_ids":[35,18],"id":33017,"title":"The Magnificent Tramp","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Archimède le clochard","overview":"Bum Archimède wants to spend the winter in prison, but to get there proves not to be that easy.","popularity":1.545,"poster_path":"/gc3x0hGUUzdCxYgcxPzcdOdEBlX.jpg","release_date":"1959-04-08","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7,"vote_count":45}],"total_pages":1001,"total_res